  "ruleText": "Saf-C 701.01 Chapter Definitions. The following terms shall be construed as set forth unless the text clearly indicates otherwise:\n\n(a) \"Applicant\" means a person intending to fulfill the statutory and administrative requirements to obtain an appointment within the meaning of RSA 381:2;\n\n(b) \"Commissioner\" means the commissioner of the department of safety or a designee thereof;\n\n(c) \"Department\" means the New Hampshire department of safety;\n\n(d) \"Officer\" means a person holding a valid commission as a railroad police officer; and\n\n(e) \"Railroad\" means “railroad” as defined in RSA 381:1.\n\nSource. #2281, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2790, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5067, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6456, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRED: 6-21-97; ss by #6473, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8776, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10889, eff 7-16-15",
